or did Erin take care of that problem?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Litera scripta manet&quot;<br /> Check out my blog at <a href=\"http://www.murkypool.blogspot.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.murkypool.blogspot.com</a><br /> <br /> Hire me! Copywriting, Adobe InDesign work, Grant Writing, Social Media Managment, RPG writing and more! Contact at <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#422f23362a36302d2c2b3a02252f232b2e6c212d2f\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"99f4f8edf1edebf6f7f0e1d9fef4f8f0f5b7faf6f4\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3381-murky-master","name":"Murky Master","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3381_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T19:34:49-08:00","id":304041,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Erin identifies as non-gendered, and the preferred pronoun is \u2018They\u2019. They appear very very androgynous</span></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> but they aren\u2019t the type to correct people on pronoun use, and just prefers to let others struggle it out. However, people who know Erin well will use they. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">ah, I just meant that they had an enemy in town, could be vampire or werewolf but its one person not a group. Someone wronged Erin in the past and Erin is here to even the score. i was originally thinking vampire but if a werewolf makes more sense thats cool too! I\u2019ll just need a bit to cook up the why lol.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Erin\u2019s sire is still \u2018alive,\u2019 however they are no longer influential to Erin because he incurred a life boon and is blood bonded to another kindred in the Camarilla. Erin hasn\u2019t heard from him in a while, but assumes that he is still around the USA. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">On a side note i began writing up a intro that has Erin retainer ghoul doing things, because FeroKE started during the day, should i shelf that idea and go with the intro that you were going to write?</span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4154-mosssocks","name":"MossSocks","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4154_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T05:13:30-08:00","id":304458,"title":"","content":"Moss Socks: I would like to see what you have in mind for an intro. Go right ahead.<br /> I am guessing Erin is Camirilla?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Litera scripta manet&quot;<br /> Check out my blog at <a href=\"http://www.murkypool.blogspot.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.murkypool.blogspot.com</a><br /> <br /> Hire me! Copywriting, Adobe InDesign work, Grant Writing, Social Media Managment, RPG writing and more! Contact at <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#0865697c607c7a67666170486f65696164266b6765\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"fe939f8a968a8c91909786be99939f9792d09d9193\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3381-murky-master","name":"Murky Master","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3381_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-06T14:50:25-08:00","id":305031,"title":"","content":"Gabriel is from Baton Rouge, not New Orleans. The three bone gnawers will most likely still believe him to be a Ragabash Silent Strider, which he generally poses as when dealing with Garou. Also, can you clarify the gender of the Silent Strider? in the first post you called it a she, in the second a he...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4148,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4148-feroke","user":"FeroKE","date":". 11-06-2014, 06:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4148-feroke","name":"FeroKE","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-09T19:32:11-08:00","id":307745,"title":"","content":"Oh, oops. I'll make those changes FeroKE. <br /> <br /> I'll probably be updating on Tuesday. Monday is packed. Mind you, I have been working on the next set of posts since Thursday, but I'm overthinking it. I'll start over and make responses for FeroKE, Blue Thomas, and Akataski on Tuesday.<br /> <br /> My policy is to include either a roll for you to make, an &quot;actionable&quot; piece of info, or some decision to make in each post. This may mean some psots run long, while others may be very brief. Please call me out if I fail to do so. <br /> <br /> Akatasuki has joined us as a Tzimice, by the way. Can't wait to see what happens next...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Litera scripta manet&quot;<br /> Check out my blog at <a href=\"http://www.murkypool.blogspot.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.murkypool.blogspot.com</a><br /> <br /> Hire me! Copywriting, Adobe InDesign work, Grant Writing, Social Media Managment, RPG writing and more! Contact at <